+
+## [0.1000.3]
+
+Merges upstream dxvk-remix `main` of 2026-11-23 (upstream API `0.6.13`). Additive:
+a `0.1000.2` client is written only the interface it knows (the 43 functions up to
+`AddWaterDisturbance`), and `0.1000.0` and `0.1000.1` clients the 41 functions up to
+`GetGameValue`, so their binaries keep working unchanged.
+
+### Added
+- remixapi_SceneInstanceHandle and remixapi_Interface.SceneInstanceAdd,
+  SceneInstanceUpdate, SceneInstanceRemove and UpdateMaterial, appended after
+  AddWaterDisturbance (upstream 0.6.12 appends them after AddWaterDisturbance too,
+  where its interface is shorter). They require `rtx.gpuResidentScene`
+  (experimental, off by default) and return `REMIXAPI_ERROR_CODE_GENERAL_FAILURE`
+  while it is off. See [GpuResidentScene.md](GpuResidentScene.md).
+- remixapi_InstanceInfoParticleSpawnMaskEXT as struct type 34 (33 upstream,
+  where the fork's PARTICLE_SCREEN_SIZE_EXT stands): emitter-material alpha or
+  luminance birth masking. See [particle-spawn-masking.md](particle-spawn-masking.md).
